.TH TICTACTOE 1
.SH NAME
tictactoe \- tic-tac-toe
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/tictactoe
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I TicTacToe
is a tic-tac-toe.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Button 1 places marks for two local players on a 3×3 board.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B LMB
Place mark in cell
.TP
.B Enter / r
Restart
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/tictactoe.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR wm (1)
